- Add gradle.properties with Rapunzel config placeholders
- Inject 18 BuildConfig fields from gradle.properties/local.properties
- Create AppConfig singleton (@Inject) for runtime typed config access
- Rename root project from Emaki to Rapunzel
- Remove static app_name from strings.xml (now dynamic via resValue)
- Inject AppConfig into EasyReaderApplication, log version on startup
- Create rapunzel-ci.yml: aggressive caching, secrets injection,
  dynamic release naming ({APP_NAME} v{VERSION}), auto-cleanup

Refs: docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §4, §11, §14 Phase 0
